<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> YOUR CARE, IN ONE PLACE</div><h1>Better care starts with a <em>connected</em> you.</h1><p>Find trusted doctors, book a consultation, and get everyday essentials delivered. Thoughtful healthcare, made simpler.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/doctors">Find a doctor <span>→</span></a><a class="button button-outline" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/medicines">Explore pharmacy</a></div><div class="trust-line"><span class="avatar-stack"><i>+</i><i>+</i><i>+</i></span><span>Care designed around your everyday</span></div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="art-glow"></div><div class="care-card appointment-card"><div class="card-top"><span class="icon-tile mint">✚</span><span class="pill pill-green">Available today</span></div><div class="doctor-mini"><div class="doctor-avatar">MI</div><div><strong>Dr. Meera Iyer</strong><span>Cardiology · 12 years</span></div></div><div class="slot-line"><span>Next appointment</span><strong>10:00 AM <span>·</span> Video</strong></div><a class="button button-full" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/doctors">Book a consultation</a></div><div class="floating-note"><span class="icon-tile lavender">♡</span><span><strong>Care that connects</strong><small>Doctors, pharmacy, you.</small></span></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="art-orbit orbit-two"></div></div></section>
<section class="trust-strip"><div><strong>Qualified professionals</strong><span>Explore doctor profiles and availability</span></div><div><strong>Care on your schedule</strong><span>Choose from available consultation slots</span></div><div><strong>Local demo payments</strong><span>Safe simulation for project workflows</span></div></section>
<section class="section-block"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</div><h2>Care, without the extra steps.</h2></div><p>From your first search to your follow-up, the essentials are all in one place.</p></div><div class="steps-grid"><article class="step-card"><span class="step-no">01</span><span class="icon-tile mint">⌕</span><h3>Find your care</h3><p>Browse doctors by speciality, experience, and consultation fee.</p></article><article class="step-card"><span class="step-no">02</span><span class="icon-tile lavender">◷</span><h3>Book a time</h3><p>Choose an open slot and reserve your consultation in a few clicks.</p></article><article class="step-card"><span class="step-no">03</span><span class="icon-tile peach">＋</span><h3>Stay connected</h3><p>Keep consultations, prescriptions, and pharmacy orders together.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="cta-band"><div><div class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">YOUR HEALTH, YOUR WAY</div><h2>Make room for better care.</h2><p>Start with a doctor or find the essentials you need.</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button button-white" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/register">Get started</a><a class="text-link light-link" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/medicines">Browse medicines →</a></div></section>
